1. Start Jenkins - sudo systemctl start jenkins
2. Enable Jenkins - sudo systemctl enable jenkins
3. Check status - sudo systemctl status jenkins
4. Open JEnkins - http://localhost:8080
5. Create a new Item - Name it, select pipeline and click ok
Method-1: 
Under definition Add this pipeline script
pipeline {
    agent any
    stages {
        stage('Build') {
            steps {
                echo 'Building...'
            }
        }
        stage('Test') {
            steps {
                echo 'Testing...'
            }
        }
        stage('Deploy') {
            steps {
                echo 'Deploying...'
            }
        }
    }
}
Click save
Click on Build now
This creates a pipeline : a sequence of automated stages that Jenkins executes one after another

Method-2:
Under Definition : select Pipeline script from SCM
Under SCM add git : Paste the github URL
Change the branch specifier to */main
Under script path enter the file you want to implement CI/CD
Save
Build Now

